From: lux <dev@lux.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: load MoltenVK from @rpath/LibMoltenVK.framework

B+(2026-11-10):MoltenVK 改为共享 framework 分发。libavutil 在 Apple 上
dlopen 的候选名里加上 @rpath/LibMoltenVK.framework/LibMoltenVK,放在
libvulkan* 之前,让 app bundle 的 LC_RPATH 解析到唯一一份共享 MoltenVK。

本补丁为 lux 原创,LGPL-2.1+;不改变非 Apple 平台与 libvulkan 的优先级。

---
diff --git a/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c b/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c
index 65e2256..ae06d4c 100644
--- a/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c
+++ b/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c
@@ -639,6 +639,9 @@ static int load_libvulkan(AVHWDeviceContext *ctx)
 #if defined(_WIN32)
         "vulkan-1.dll",
 #elif defined(__APPLE__)
+        /* lux(B+): MoltenVK is shipped as @rpath/LibMoltenVK.framework.
+         * Try it first so the app bundle's LC_RPATH resolves the shared copy. */
+        "@rpath/LibMoltenVK.framework/LibMoltenVK",
         "libvulkan.dylib",
         "libvulkan.1.dylib",
         "libMoltenVK.dylib",
